{"id": "EUVD-2026-98009", "enisaUuid": "d94369b7-9c20-3411-8d8d-cbcfe8b61d8c", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.121.0 and 16.x before 16.34.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in certain endpoints that fail to enforce proper permission checks during document creation. Authenticated low-privileged users can call these endpoints to create documents against records beyond their permitted role, bypassing role-based access controls.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:45:45", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-vg6r-89q7-wh34", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.121.0-missing-authorization-in-document-creation-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109615", "GHSA-8wwp-crfw-r69p"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "32d864fe-6525-3e0e-8f1c-9291b418c0d2", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.34.0"}, {"id": "50265ae0-4eb3-3a2b-9d37-83366e3e3960", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.121.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "64fb58fc-470b-3a34-a22b-064b8b42ec63", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}